# Note: data/chroma_db IS committed on purpose - it's the pre-built search
# index, and committing it means deployment doesn't need to re-download
# PDFs or re-run embeddings on every deploy. Not best practice for a large
# production system (you'd use a managed vector DB), but a reasonable,
# transparent shortcut for a portfolio deployment.
